HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_4858290b, ", found `");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_6190a1bb, "a `cstr` is C's string, not this language's \342\200\224 `c.validated()` copies one into a `str?`, which is `null_cstr` for a null pointer and `not_text` for bytes that are not UTF-8");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_66070846, "unordered_element");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_19f11d9f, "`sort` orders arrays of numbers, `str` and `bool` \342\200\224 `[");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_18204300, "]` is none of those");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_3274b0a6, "` is a type parameter, so this line cannot know whether it has an order \342\200\224 take the comparison as a parameter instead, `less: (function(candidate: ");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_61b5d126, ", best: ");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_1c690931, ") -> bool)`, and name its arguments at the call, `less(candidate: x, best: best)`: two parameters of one type are named in the type, so the order of the two is checked for you");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_65446aba, ", which has no order the language can produce. Sort a key you can name instead \342\200\224 build `[i64]`, `[str]` or `[bool]` from the values and order that");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_5f6ff10d, "the ordered types are `i8` `i16` `i32` `i64`, `u8` `u16` `u32` `u64`, `f32` `f64`, `str` and `bool`. Sort a key you can name instead \342\200\224 build an array of one of those from the values and order that");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_31fb6b66, "not_bool");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_44bed2a7, " must be `bool`, found `");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_67774620, "` \342\200\224 there is no truthiness in this language");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_6c96db06, "`main` produces nothing, and this one is declared `-> ");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_ce3bb78, "` \342\200\224 a program reports failure by what it prints, not by what it returns");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_d326e2c, "drop the result type; a value `main` computed and returned would have nowhere to go");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_3e986870, ", and `_ = \342\200\246` will not do either: a `T?` may not be discarded");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_7e921a65, "this line's value has type `");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_7fca5572, "` and nothing receives it");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_3f7b55a3, "answer the error instead: `?` sends it to your caller, `.must()` ends the program, `.default(v)` falls back, `.is_err()` drops it on purpose");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_6a28982a, " \342\200\224 write `_ = \342\200\246` to discard it on purpose");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_4ddea25c, "discard it explicitly");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_cc34cfc, "_ = ");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_529ddf53, "` and nothing receives it \342\200\224 every value here is a copy, so `");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_f411b86, "` is unchanged: write `");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_24b1c74f, " @ \342\200\246` to keep the result");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_3ad10705, "assign it back to `");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_3c07ab0c, ", or `_ = \342\200\246` to discard it on purpose");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_6e16c64d, "`?` sends the failure to your caller, ");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_2a84dc1, "`.must()` ends the program here, ");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_23c18b07, "`.default(v)` falls back, ");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_22f3151f, "`.is_err()` drops the failure on purpose");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_4c4b2349, " \342\200\224 `?` would need this function to return a `T?` itself");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_49765747, "`_ =` would drop the error in this `");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_3968265b, "`, and that is the one discard the type system cannot see through \342\200\224 ");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_5fe4ef6, "send the failure to your caller");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_36d08fc6, "end the program if it fails");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_c1c8b52, "drop the failure on purpose");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_69258bd1, ".is_err()");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_2edbc49b, "a `_` parameter written `");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_12d86c26, "` drops its error where nothing can answer it \342\200\224 `_` binds nothing, so the body cannot reach the value at all");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_48c38276, "give it a name, and answer the error in the body");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_64a10023, "` would hold `()`, which is no value \342\200\224 keep the call and drop the binding");
HERO_STR_STATIC(hero_str_3b936806, "remove `");
